230
00:07:37,724 --> 00:07:39,987
centers in America.

231
00:07:40,250 --> 00:07:41,260
And at home,

232
00:07:41,260 --> 00:07:44,110
the region is building giant AI campuses

233
00:07:44,110 --> 00:07:45,379
in the desert,

234
00:07:45,379 --> 00:07:48,310
powered by cheap sunshine and gas.

235
00:07:48,490 --> 00:07:51,352
Saudi Arabia's sovereign fund launched an

236
00:07:51,352 --> 00:07:53,236
AI company of its own,

237
00:07:53,236 --> 00:07:54,790
called HUMAIN.

238
00:07:54,860 --> 00:07:56,450
The bet is simple.

239
00:07:56,450 --> 00:07:58,189
If you can't make the shovels,

240
00:07:58,189 --> 00:08:00,550
