241
00:08:00,830 --> 00:08:02,957
We followed the power side in Could

242
00:08:02,957 --> 00:08:05,897
Cheap Electricity Become the New Oil?

243
00:08:06,150 --> 00:08:06,997
Sixth stamp,

244
00:08:06,997 --> 00:08:09,350
the mountains of Chile.

245
00:08:09,450 --> 00:08:11,639
Giant trucks haul copper ore up out

246
00:08:11,639 --> 00:08:13,060
