247
00:08:13,200 --> 00:08:15,647
Copper is the wire inside every data

248
00:08:15,647 --> 00:08:16,239
center,

249
00:08:16,239 --> 00:08:19,490
every power line and every chip package.

250
00:08:19,550 --> 00:08:22,547
And Chile mines almost one in every

251
00:08:22,547 --> 00:08:24,896
