255
00:08:30,197 --> 00:08:32,623
the metal in the batteries that back

256
00:08:32,623 --> 00:08:33,812
up power grids,

257
00:08:33,812 --> 00:08:36,111
phones and electric cars.

258
00:08:36,350 --> 00:08:37,930
Here's the twist.

259
00:08:37,930 --> 00:08:41,370
The International Energy Agency forecasts

260
00:08:41,370 --> 00:08:43,893
that the copper mines already planned

261
00:08:43,893 --> 00:08:45,727
