273
00:09:06,613 --> 00:09:08,213
Nugget gulps.

274
00:09:08,213 --> 00:09:10,533
So metal is a shovel anyone can

275
00:09:10,533 --> 00:09:11,365
sell.

276
00:09:15,817 --> 00:09:18,057
Back to the Gold Rush.

277
00:09:18,057 --> 00:09:20,257
What happened to Sam Brannan?

278
00:09:20,257 --> 00:09:21,250
Years later,

279
00:09:21,250 --> 00:09:23,008
