289
00:09:41,460 --> 00:09:43,319
We told that story in The Three

290
00:09:43,319 --> 00:09:46,108
Companies That Decide How Much Your Memory

291
00:09:46,108 --> 00:09:46,940
Costs.

292
00:09:47,183 --> 00:09:49,323
So which shovels last?

